      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_832738d728f217f0_1",
        "edit": "Fix the two malformed binary literals in the case statement: 3'b100 was 8'b0001_000 (7 bits, value 8) and is corrected to 8'b0001_0000 (value 16); 3'b111 was 8'b100_0000 (7 bits, value 64) and is corrected to 8'b1000_0000 (value 128). This aligns the one-hot outputs with the expected oracle values at cycles 9 and 15.",
